{"id":12996397,"name":"Mega Fun Obby Revamped⭐2935 Stages","desc":"🚨 GAME IS FULLY REDESIGNED! Post in the forum if you come across any issues, please!\n\nPlay Roblox's longest and most fun obstacle course experience! With currently over 2900 stages, you'll be sure to have a blast playing this game for hours by yourself, or with friends and family!\n\nJoin the official community for free skips!\n\n📅 Update: 24 June, 2026\n- 5 New Stages\n- Fixed multiple stages\n\n📅 Update: 19 June, 2026\n- Redesigned Progress Bar\n- Added Fast Forward Stage Selector\n- Added Daily Challenges\n- Resized Side UI for Mobile\n- Fixed 20+ Stages\n- Added Icon Hover & Click Effect\n- Remade the Loading Screen\n- Added Background Music\n\n🔨Builder🔨 - Bloxtun\n📜 Scripter 📜 - Wrathsong ","path":"/game/12996397-mega-fun-obby-revamped-2935-stages","slug":"12996397-mega-fun-obby-revamped-2935-stages","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f0f90f897c79a321df5aa8fb8da57b3c005e1bfd9f4fed982833ad7d5770189d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e449804cd1d0caa88f8a71813b1f47b9/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":29,"visitor":1164728304,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-11T17:20:43.782Z","creator":{"name":"Bloxtun's Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"68ea91eb9c55f8d3c5ecd1f3","title":"Auto Complete","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c78d7b","gameId":12996397,"name":"Mega Fun Obby Revamped⭐2935 Stages","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f0f90f897c79a321df5aa8fb8da57b3c005e1bfd9f4fed982833ad7d5770189d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e449804cd1d0caa88f8a71813b1f47b9/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"12996397-mega-fun-obby-revamped-2935-stages","path":"/game/12996397-mega-fun-obby-revamped-2935-stages","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f0f90f897c79a321df5aa8fb8da57b3c005e1bfd9f4fed982833ad7d5770189d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e449804cd1d0caa88f8a71813b1f47b9/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"placeId":12996397},"slug":"Mega-Fun-Obby-2895-Stages-Auto-Complete-57756","verified":true,"key":false,"keyless":true,"views":2109128,"executes":216,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f3949582f8336f82b70f8c7f5910475c86c0263fd5907235c36e2a822edc9685.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-827fd3c24a1327a6316db94e6da1a18a-919038672057.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-827fd3c24a1327a6316db94e6da1a18a-919038672057.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f3949582f8336f82b70f8c7f5910475c86c0263fd5907235c36e2a822edc9685.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-827fd3c24a1327a6316db94e6da1a18a-919038672057.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-827fd3c24a1327a6316db94e6da1a18a-919038672057.png"},"likeCount":5,"dislikeCount":2,"createdAt":"2025-10-11T17:20:43.783Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-11T17:20:43.783Z","lastBump":"2025-10-11T17:20:43.783Z","script":"local Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal LocalPlayer = Players.LocalPlayer\nlocal Character = LocalPlayer.Character\nlocal RootPart = Character.HumanoidRootPart\n\nlocal stages = workspace.stages\nlocal currentstage = LocalPlayer.leaderstats.Stage\n\nlocal function FindNextPortal()\n\tfor i,v in pairs(workspace:GetChildren()) do\n\t\tif v.Name == \"Stage Teleport\" and #v:GetChildren() == 4 then\n\t\t\tlocal enter = v:FindFirstChild(\"enter\")\n\t\t\tif enter ~= nil then\n\t\t\t\treturn enter\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\nend\n\nlocal function Touch(Part)\n\tfiretouchinterest(RootPart, Part, 0)\n\tfiretouchinterest(RootPart, Part, 1)\nend\nwhile task.wait() do\n\tlocal CurrentStage = stages:FindFirstChild(tostring(currentstage.Value))\n\tlocal NextStage = stages:FindFirstChild(tostring(currentstage.Value + 1))\n\tlocal NextNextStage = stages:FindFirstChild(tostring(currentstage.Value + 1))\n\tRootPart.CFrame = CurrentStage.CFrame * CFrame.new(0,3,0)\n\tif NextStage then\n\t\tTouch(NextStage)\n\t\t--Potential Speed Gain?\n\t\tif NextNextStage then\n\t\t\tTouch(NextNextStage)\n\t\tend\n\telse\n\t\tlocal NextPortal = FindNextPortal()\n\t\tif NextPortal then\n\t\t\tRootPart.CFrame = NextPortal.CFrame\n\t\telse\n\t\t\tRootPart.CFrame = CurrentStage.CFrame\n\t\tend\n\t\ttask.wait(1)\n\tend\nend\nfor i,v in pairs(workspace.badges:GetChildren()) do\n\tif v.Name == \"Platform\" then\n\t\tTouch(v)\n\tend\nend","features":"It does the obby as quick as it can.","tags":["auto","complete","stage","fast","free"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"61ecdfff4351a4a73af593b8","username":"Tomato","verified":true,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/98956ce63453a3d326475e182567911881cb1c96f4c90cf0ba0cd6958de8957f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/61ecdfff4351a4a73af593b8-1714691274203.png"},"lvl":23,"status":"offline","id":"61ecdfff4351a4a73af593b8","leaderboard":{"tag":{"kind":"hall","rank":5,"period":"all","metric":"views","value":11039942}},"topMilestone":{"key":"creator.views","tier":10000000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/98956ce63453a3d326475e182567911881cb1c96f4c90cf0ba0cd6958de8957f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/61ecdfff4351a4a73af593b8-1714691274203.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-20T02:56:37.109Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"68ea91eb9c55f8d3c5ecd1f5","editBy":{"_id":"61ecdfff4351a4a73af593b8","username":"Tomato","status":"offline","id":"61ecdfff4351a4a73af593b8"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-10-11T17:20:43.787Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"68ea975b588f17d4abbab002","commentBy":{"_id":"67abe6a04114c8c3c604a5aa","username":